                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3185c3b5-49f6-3d95-a5ca-3d2e7dd62e2e",
                        "entry_id": "e2754aa8-c776-3431-ad53-9555319791e4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "полит. приверженец, представитель шовинизма"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "95385b68-9b26-4191-a279-3384a6d06436",
                                "sense_id": "3185c3b5-49f6-3d95-a5ca-3d2e7dd62e2e",
                                "text": "Оба, впрочем, были германскими шовинистами ещё и тогда ― накануне первой мировой войны. Но кто же в ту пору мог предугадать, сколько человеческой крови будет пролито и сколько бесчеловечных низостей будет совершено под идиотски-ликующий припев: «Германия, Германия превыше всего…»?!"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f8643024-8a74-4423-80b4-49a4f6a106a7",
                        "source_entry_id": "e2754aa8-c776-3431-ad53-9555319791e4",
                        "source_sense_id": "3185c3b5-49f6-3d95-a5ca-3d2e7dd62e2e",
                        "target_lang_word": "chauvinist",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "chauvinist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cb7325db-c45d-3ee4-8bee-8eaf267b4f61",
                                        "entry_id": "ebf804e3-71bf-3fd0-a869-cf18c4128275",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pertaining to chauvinism."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bda1b947-7f35-49e9-8a96-725b4267fd36",
                                                "sense_id": "cb7325db-c45d-3ee4-8bee-8eaf267b4f61",
                                                "text": "Today's young women seem to be outdoing the male chauvinist pigs of yesteryear, applauding the \"pornification\" of other women […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "57ab5840-0e67-3a75-a755-1fedb5426dd5",
                                        "entry_id": "ebf804e3-71bf-3fd0-a869-cf18c4128275",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Chauvinistic; excessively patriotic or heavily biased."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "chauvinist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e41eb108-76df-3f2b-8bd1-100028d14aa5",
                                        "entry_id": "ad26010e-01ff-30c4-92c2-5bd432e01143",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A chauvinistic person."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c28ca87d-5e44-4469-a795-63f7b313c406",
                                                "sense_id": "e41eb108-76df-3f2b-8bd1-100028d14aa5",
                                                "text": "Any one of the three corners could represent one of the three constituents of Iranian tri-polar culture—pan-Islamists, anti-Islam Persian chauvinists and Westernized Islamophobians."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "11efc98d-9698-4ccd-b441-d91b045a5b94",
                        "source_entry_id": "e2754aa8-c776-3431-ad53-9555319791e4",
                        "source_sense_id": "3185c3b5-49f6-3d95-a5ca-3d2e7dd62e2e",
                        "target_lang_word": "jingo",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "jingo",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "82395a11-ec50-338b-bf2d-08c775dac895",
                                        "entry_id": "a6d69f8a-0d31-3af0-9898-75b7919ad8ed",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who supports policy favouring war."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "858e384a-fadf-4a96-bde4-0c944e47a06f",
                                                "sense_id": "82395a11-ec50-338b-bf2d-08c775dac895",
                                                "text": "1897 June 19, Carl Schurz, editorial: Armed or Unarmed Peace in Harper's Weekly, reprinted in 1913, Frederic Bancroft (editor), Speeches, Correspondence and Political Papers of Carl Schurz,\nThe fact is that Mr. Roosevelt has always with perfect frankness confessed himself to be what is currently called a Jingo."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f15b3c65-317c-41c9-b0e5-4700e29754fc",
                                                "sense_id": "82395a11-ec50-338b-bf2d-08c775dac895",
                                                "text": "He is the jingo of the universe; he will say, \"My cosmos, right or wrong.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b770baf9-9ca3-4d4d-9be5-1ae4ccbc1d48",
                                                "sense_id": "82395a11-ec50-338b-bf2d-08c775dac895",
                                                "text": "\"We are all jingoes now,\" the New York Sun wrote immediately after the 1898 war, \"and the head jingo is the Hon. William McKinley.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b2cef30a-fec2-43c1-a5a4-a3b746fa7142",
                                                "sense_id": "82395a11-ec50-338b-bf2d-08c775dac895",
                                                "text": "Spare me all the outrage and \"pseudo jingo stuff\" about Iran's imprisonment of our troops, said Peter Hitchens in The Mail on Sunday."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0fbccf95-52cb-4c4e-8376-bb7fa339ab16",
                        "source_entry_id": "e2754aa8-c776-3431-ad53-9555319791e4",
                        "source_sense_id": "3185c3b5-49f6-3d95-a5ca-3d2e7dd62e2e",
                        "target_lang_word": "jingoist",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "jingoist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dfba1b94-0982-36fc-866f-e16b69a1307d",
                                        "entry_id": "180f0f2a-518f-3b36-825d-3f7947dd6d7f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who advocates an aggressive nationalism; one who vociferously supports a nation's military aims."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "863511b0-343a-4efe-8b09-15346dff9595",
                                                "sense_id": "dfba1b94-0982-36fc-866f-e16b69a1307d",
                                                "text": "The term \"jingoist;\" or its equivalent, was applied to Washington and Henry, to Jefferson and Jackson. It was applied to James G. Blaine, the typical American of his time -- a man from beneath whose very toe-nails enough intellect might be scraped to make an hundred Clevelands or McKinleys. All were jingoes in their day and generation, because all preferred the title of sovereign to that of subject..."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "jingoist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "833311a8-7cdd-3d46-9530-bca1600d0a4a",
                                        "entry_id": "6f7d0889-7636-32f7-b378-9c434533002a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Jingoistic; extremely supportive of warlike foreign policy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "14aa1402-7e0e-4b18-9b13-6e0ea2b27194",
                                                "sense_id": "833311a8-7cdd-3d46-9530-bca1600d0a4a",
                                                "text": "When liberals did acknowledge the persistence of the covenant theme, they treated it like some atavistic beast, lumping it together with the largely aberrant doctrines of ultra-right-wingers, \"Jewish conspiracy\" advocates, Nazi sympathizers, and jingoist fanatics."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1607a191-3688-4163-b2cc-af4119d32d65",
                        "source_entry_id": "e2754aa8-c776-3431-ad53-9555319791e4",
                        "source_sense_id": "3185c3b5-49f6-3d95-a5ca-3d2e7dd62e2e",
                        "target_lang_word": "chovinista",
                        "target_lang_code": "it",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fb103a75-e389-4c72-ab7f-19562c32dc78",
                        "source_entry_id": "e2754aa8-c776-3431-ad53-9555319791e4",
                        "source_sense_id": "3185c3b5-49f6-3d95-a5ca-3d2e7dd62e2e",
                        "target_lang_word": "Chauvinist",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Chauvinist",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d924e65f-854c-31c2-8647-2ff60d2c487e",
                                        "entry_id": "06061deb-837d-309c-880d-5ee12ff38f6a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "jemand mit extrem sexistischer Einstellung beziehungsweise übersteigertem Männlichkeitsgefühl"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "69fc35ea-8e0b-4fc5-a2e0-9fcf7da152dc",
                                                "sense_id": "d924e65f-854c-31c2-8647-2ff60d2c487e",
                                                "text": "Manchen Frauen gegenüber gibt er sich als echter Chauvinist."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f3be3568-9d84-3161-8a64-0dfdc1454702",
                                        "entry_id": "06061deb-837d-309c-880d-5ee12ff38f6a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "jemand mit exzessivem/übersteigertem Patriotismus oder Nationalismus"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "667d9e96-f3ef-4591-a285-38a8a9b38878",
                                                "sense_id": "f3be3568-9d84-3161-8a64-0dfdc1454702",
                                                "text": "„Bei diesem Thema liebte er es übrigens, den Chauvinisten zu spielen; natürlich nicht aus Überzeugung, sondern aus Lust am größtmöglichen Umtriebe.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4f943088-f4e9-431b-b5f8-85a5da3b443e",
                        "source_entry_id": "e2754aa8-c776-3431-ad53-9555319791e4",
